          "jcr:created": "Fri Nov 08 2019 19:10:41 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">A history of</span><br>\n <span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #85458a;\">excellence</span></span></span></p>\n<p>When your founder is a surgeon, every product you make is held to a different standard. Every Stryker power tool needs to live up to our rigorous internal standards before it ever makes it to your operating room. We develop and test our products in ways that exceed the demands of real-life situations.</p>\n",
