          "jcr:created": "Fri Nov 08 2019 19:10:41 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Innovation is a</span><br>\n <span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #85458a;\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">universal language</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>We involve surgical experts from all over the world—at every step of our research, development, and testing process—to develop innovative power tools that are built to exceed customer expectations. By utilizing our learnings, Stryker is able to take the best data, feedback, and insights from around the world and offer you unique forward-thinking products, services, and support programs globally.</p>\n",
