          "jcr:created": "Fri Nov 08 2019 19:10:41 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Solutions</span><br>\n <span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #85458a;\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\"><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\">tailored to you</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>Every customer and surgical setting has specific needs, which is why Stryker offers a complete line of products and attachments for the operating room, along with programs and services designed around you hospital or surgery center's unique situation. Stryker treats every customer as a long-term surgical power tools partner. From day one we offer you unsurpassed sales, service, and financing support. Your Stryker power tools experience is tailored to you.</p>\n",
